        {"objects": [{"type":"dynamic","data":{"position":{"x":3,"y":1},"name":"show_text_fullscreen","options":{"text":
            "(Mr. Bennet approaches a woman wandering aimlessly about)\nMr. Bennet: Good day m’lady.\nBeatrice (Looking away from Mr. Bennet): Are you trying to flirt with me sir! How disgusting!\nMr. Bennet: Absolutely not ma’am, I have a wife. I am not in need of your companionship!\nBeatrice: Well then, I have a husband whom I am in an exceedingly happy marriage with!\nMr. Bennet: Anyway, have you seen a young lady-\nBeatrice: What does your wife look like? Is she pretty?\nMr. Bennet: Not particularly but over the years we have come to understand each other.\nBeatrice: Oh! Well, I’m not married, you can marry me, you know.\nMr. Bennet: (Sigh, god this woman is awful) I have already stated, I am not looking for your companionship! I am looking for a young lady, have you seen her?\nBeatrice: Oh my! You’re with another lady?! What about your wife!\nMr. Bennet: She’s my daughter and she’s run off with a despicable sort of man. So, have you seen her?\nBeatrice: Oh no, absolutely not! I’m blind after all!\nMr. Bennet: (What a horrible waste of time) Well goodbye then!\n(Mr. Bennet, having learned absolutely nothing decides to make his way to /gHunsford to ask Mr. Collins about the situation)"
        }}}]},
        {"objects": [{"type":"dynamic","data":{"position":{"x":3,"y":1},"name":"show_text_fullscreen","options":{"text":
            "(Mr. Bennet finds Mr. Collins)\nMr. Bennet: Well hello there Mr. Collins!\nMr. Collins: Why hello there to you too Mr. Bennet!\nMr. Bennet: Say, have you seen my lovely daughter Lydia run through here with Wickham as of recent.\nMr. Collins: I can’t say I have-\nMr. Bennet: (God what a waste of time) Thank you then Mr. Collins.\nMr. Collins: Wait! I did see them on their way to /gLondon when I was heading there myself last.\nMr. Bennet: Wha- Why thank you greatly, good sir!\nMr. Collins: Any time!\n( Mr. Bennet hurries off to catch a carriage to /gLondon )"
        }}}]},
